{"id": "69829", "title": "少将哥哥，别爱我", "author": "若竹", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 29, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/69/69829.htm", "intro": "十八岁的他，无法舍弃对妹妹的欲望，毅然自我放逐，全国理科状元却选择进了军校。八年的放逐，他以为不止练就了强健的身体，还有钢铁一般坚不可摧的心。 \r\n　　却不知他筑起的万里长城，敌得过千军万马，却敌不过她于人群中回眸一笑… \r\n　　如果爱是一种原罪，我愿意永远为你背负这宗罪！by宁希唯 \r\n　　【兄控妹控】　　10岁的豆芽菜一般的小丫头往少年身上一依：“哥哥，我…”少年笑着：“来，哥哥帮你！” \r\n　　14岁的高挑苗条少女像猴子般挂在手长脚长的小男人身上：“哥哥，我…”小男人端着脸：“你是长不大的丫头吗？” \r\n　　22岁的玲珑诱人的女子在高大的男人怀里蹭着：“哥哥，我…”男人幽深的眸子亮光闪过：“要我帮你，得付出代价…” 【高干+宠文+伪兄妹恋】\r\n　　本文的实质，是腹黑哥哥一步一步将貌似纯良无害的妹妹拆吃入腹的宠文一枚。", "base": "files/article/html/69/69829", "chapters": [{"title": "1-5", "file": "10705672.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "10705673.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-15", "file": "10705674.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-20", "file": "10705675.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-25", "file": "10705676.html", "available": false}, {"title": "26-33", "file": "10705677.html", "available": false}, {"title": "34-40", "file": "10705678.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-50", "file": "10705679.html", "available": false}, {"title": "51-60", "file": "10705680.html", "available": false}, {"title": "1-10", "file": "10705681.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-13", "file": "10705682.html", "available": false}, {"title": "14-15", "file": "10705683.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-17", "file": "10705684.html", "available": false}, {"title": "18-19", "file": "10705685.html", "available": false}, {"title": "20-21", "file": "10705686.html", "available": false}, {"title": "22-23", "file": "10705687.html", "available": false}, {"title": "24-25", "file": "10705688.html", "available": false}, {"title": "26-28", "file": "10705689.html", "available": false}, {"title": "29-30", "file": "10705690.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-34", "file": "10705691.html", "available": false}, {"title": "35-37", "file": "10705692.html", "available": false}, {"title": "38-39", 